<title>BRAZIL: Telesp Jan-Feb net 153.004 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Telesp Jan-Feb net 153.004 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Sao Paulo state telecomunications company Telecomunicacoes de Sao Paulo S.A, Telesp issued the following consolidated results for January and February.</p>
<p>				    Jan-Feb 1997</p>
<p>    Pre Tax Revenue	     876.703</p>
<p>    Post Tax Revenue	    657.440</p>
<p>    Operational Profit	  193.661</p>
<p>    Net Profit		    153.004</p>
<p>Note - All figures in millions of reais.</p>
<p>	 - No comparative figures were provided.</p>
<p>(Dollar-Real exchangeo $1 - 1,0606 reais)</p>
<p>((--Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5410))</p>
</text>
